# Data files must be stored and checked out byte-for-byte on every platform.
# In particular, snapshot/playerlist.vorobey-hackerpolice.json is maintained by
# the sync bot as an exact replica of the upstream Vorobey file: Git must
# never apply CRLF/LF conversion to it (or to the other JSON data files),
# regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
*.json -text
